# Debt register

> STATUS: active · YYYY-MM-DD · the single home of every known defect and debt

**Every known debt lives here and only here.** Plans carry a one-line pointer
(`→ DEBT_REGISTER D-xx`), never the entry text.

## Rules (don't break them)

1. One entry per debt, here; elsewhere only pointers.
2. Ids are never reused or renumbered; closed entries stay in place, marked ✅.
   2b. Before allocating an id, check the current maximum — parallel sessions collide.
   On collision the first commit keeps the id; the later renumbers and notes the original.
3. Reclassifying (WONTFIX, NOTE) requires the reason — the reason is the value.

## Status and priority

`🔴 OPEN` · `🟡 OPEN` (low impact) · `⚪ NOTE` · `✅ CLOSED` · `🚫 WONTFIX` (with measurement).
Priority = user-visible harm, not difficulty — wrong numbers returned silently outrank an empty result.

